sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Gateway as API Gateway
    participant Order as Order Service
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    participant Inv as Inventory Service
    participant Pay as Payment Service
    participant Notif as Notification Service

    User->>Gateway: POST /orders
    Gateway->>Order: Create Order
    Order->>MQ: publish order.created
    MQ->>Inv: consume order.created
    Inv->>MQ: publish inventory.reserved
    MQ->>Pay: consume inventory.reserved
    Pay->>MQ: publish payment.completed
    MQ->>Order: update status (COMPLETED)
    MQ->>Notif: send customer receipt
